    "previewText": "The rising incidence of Mpox cases in Africa led the World Health Organization to declare a public health emergency of international concern on 14 August 2024.1 Despite efforts to decrease the spread of Mpox, its control presents significant challenges due to complex epidemiology, evolving virological features, and variable clinical presentation. This paper ",
