    "previewText": "To the Editor, COVID-19 is an ongoing global pandemic that causes significant morbidity and mortality. Although severe pneumonia and acute respiratory distress syndrome (ARDS) are seen in the foreground, it causes widespread diseases, involving multiple organ systems in severe cases. Various immunosuppressive agents, such as corticosteroids and interleukin a",
    "abstractHtml": "",
