    "title": "R-(-)-carvone Attenuated Doxorubicin Induced Cardiotoxicity In Vivo and Potentiated Its Anticancer Toxicity In Vitro",
    "views": 6569,
    "pdfUrl": "js/data/pdfs/2176.pdf",
