    "title": "The Effect of Eccentric Exercise-Induced Delayed-Onset Muscle Soreness on Positioning Sense and Shooting Percentage in Wheelchair Basketball Players",
    "views": 6453,
    "pdfUrl": "js/data/pdfs/330.pdf",
