    "previewText": "Abstract In this study, we examined the approachto intracranial bleeding in patients with mechanical heart valves. Three patients with mechanical heart valves and intracranial hemorrhage were included in the study. We discussed the therapeutic approach to these patients and reviewed the literature on the treatment of intracranial bleeding in patients on oral anticoagulation with prosthetic heart valves.",
    "abstractHtml": "<div class=\"col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12 col-xs-12\">\n\t\t\t<h3>\r\n\tAbstract</h3>\r\n<p>\r\n\tIn this study, we examined the approachto intracranial bleeding in patients with mechanical heart valves. Three patients with mechanical heart valves and intracranial hemorrhage were included in the study. We discussed the therapeutic approach to these patients and reviewed the literature on the treatment of intracranial bleeding in patients on oral anticoagulation with prosthetic heart valves.</p>\r\n \t\t\t\t\t\t        \t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>",
